{"version":1,"content":"<p>一個國際古生物學研究團隊近日宣佈，在泰國南部發現一種此前未知的遠古巨型齧齒動物化石。這種新物種生活在約3400萬年前，其體型遠超同時代已知鼠類。研究人員認為，這項發現表明大型齧齒動物的演化歷史可能比過去認知的更加久遠，也説明東南亞在這一演化過程中扮演了重要角色。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586638.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:17:34.981065+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:53:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:10:57.734238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:10:57.734238+00:00","content_hash":"6dc963f33bfd7a23f30c8e5a36a242486ca789f7782b6d02859c8f33f7f6bd1c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}